# South Africa SDR — Extended site guide

> Outsourced South African SDR teams for US, UK, AU and EU B2B companies. Cape Town-based, English-first, GMT+2 overlap. A LeadMaker company.

This file expands on /llms.txt with longer summaries for AI agents that need more context before fetching individual pages.

---

## Homepage

**URL:** https://southafricasdr.com/

South Africa SDR is a B2B lead-generation and sales-development agency. The homepage positions dedicated South African SDRs as a cost-effective alternative to Western in-house hires: first-language English, timezone overlap with US/UK/EU, and Western business culture. Primary CTA is booking a discovery call. Tagline: "Western sales talent that actually delivers." Typical savings cited: 55–65% vs a Western SDR hire.

---

## Services

### Services hub — https://southafricasdr.com/services/

Overview of four service lines: outsourced SDR, appointment setting, customer service, and technical support. All delivered from South Africa with reps working client hours and tools (CRM, dialers, email platforms).

### SDR services — https://southafricasdr.com/services/sdr/

Core offering: dedicated South African sales development representatives who handle list building, multi-channel outreach (email, phone, LinkedIn), qualification, and meeting handoff to account executives. Includes onboarding, QA, and performance reporting. Target buyers: VP Sales, CRO, founders scaling outbound.

### Appointment setting — https://southafricasdr.com/services/appointment-setting/

Specialised meeting-booking teams focused on calendar fills rather than full-cycle SDR work. Scripts and ICP provided by client; reps book qualified discovery calls. Suited to longer sales cycles where volume and consistency matter.

### Customer service — https://southafricasdr.com/services/customer-service/

English-first support for onboarding, retention, and tier-1 client operations. Complements outbound by handling inbound client communication without the accent or timezone friction common in other offshore regions.

### Technical support — https://southafricasdr.com/services/technical-support/

Product and IT support reps trained on client documentation, ticketing systems, and escalation workflows. Useful for SaaS and technology vendors needing scalable first-line support.

